commit d486d0de8661b5aeb2a872fa38fa35183786ba58
Author: Wan-Teh Chang <wtc@google.com>
Date:   Sat Nov 23 06:27:21 2024 -0800

    av1_return_max/min_sub_pixel_mv: set sse1 output

    After "50 * error < sse" was added to tf_motion_search() in
    commit f6f2deb, av1_return_max_sub_pixel_mv() and
    av1_return_min_sub_pixel_mv() must set their sse1 output parameter,
    otherwise the local variable `sse` in tf_motion_search() will be used
    uninitialized in the AV1/MotionVectorTestLarge.OverallTest/* tests.

    TEST: Run
      test_libaom --gtest_filter=AV1/MotionVectorTestLarge.OverallTest/*
    under valgrind or MemorySanitizer.

    Change-Id: I91461d41c44f1252f22bfca40c1ba64d76482ca3

 av1/encoder/mcomp.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
===
